  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Once you were there too. You too dreamed of it, or saw it in the face of a dying friend. Don’t you remember",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 22
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "In theory they couldn’t grow together, but here they do, because here the laws of science give way to older rules",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 744
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "There were no parents to shout at you, no teachers to punish you, and there were no priests to steal your Sunday",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 897
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "you knew that nothing can be beautiful that is not dangerous",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2184
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She wants to leave it where it is, feeding her rage",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9644
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Only Flesh dies by chance. Dream and Enchantment are eternal, if we can keep them so. And we have. And we will",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10790
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "was heir to an ancient tradition, the last of his kind. Nemi, one of the most potent places of Flesh, no longer has a Ki",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10989
        }
      ],
      "words": 32
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Arms folded, motionless in mid-air, she regards the mermaids with the air of an annoyed mother",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17587
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Their song is Desire, and they sing it with their whole bodies",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19235
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "fantasy is large, and like every large thing, it can crush you",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20469
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Arcadia is lost, thinks Pan, and it is the first real thought he’s formulated since incarnating",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 21588
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "the city is where everything will end",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 22622
        }
      ],
      "words": 7
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I killed him and now I know I can kill. It’s an immense power. We all have it. You have it too. And the pirates as well",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 26535
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句14",
      "no": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "if you want information, you don’t ask, you let them talk",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 27772
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    }
